    {
      "start": 90.88,
      "end": 97.56,
      "text": " Good morning, everyone. Today we are planning the launch of the new mobile app. The release date is the 14th of November.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.217,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.375,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "start": 99.04,
      "end": 104.78,
      "text": " Thanks, Alice. The backend is almost ready. I still need to finish the payment integration, which should take three days.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.217,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.375,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "start": 105.84,
      "end": 111.24,
      "text": " I have finished the new onboarding screens and the design review is scheduled for Wednesday.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.217,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.375,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "start": 111.28,
      "end": 117.68,
      "text": " On the infrastructure side, the staging servers are ready and I will run the load test on Thursday.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.217,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.375,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "start": 118.68,
      "end": 122.86,
      "text": " I will write the release notes and update the help center before the launch.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.037,
      "compression_ratio": 1.521
    },
    {
      "start": 124.84,
      "end": 130.42,
      "text": " Great. Then I will prepare the marketing campaign and send the press release to the newsletter list by next Monday.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.037,
      "compression_ratio": 1.521
    },
    {
      "start": 131.26,
      "end": 131.74,
      "text": " Yes.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.037,
      "compression_ratio": 1.521
    },
    {
      "start": 133.7,
      "end": 139.04,
      "text": " One risk is the app store review. Last time it took a week, so we should submit the bill by the 7th of November.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.037,
      "compression_ratio": 1.521
    },
    {
      "start": 139.74,
      "end": 140.22,
      "text": " Right.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.037,
      "compression_ratio": 1.521
    },
    {
      "start": 141.52,
      "end": 143.1,
      "text": " Do we have a budget for the launch event?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.202,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.037,
      "compression_ratio": 1.521
    },
    {
      "start": 143.1,
      "end": 146.38,
      "text": " I will confirm the budget of 5,000 euros with finance.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.084,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "start": 147.82,
      "end": 152.42,
      "text": " I can prepare the demo videos for the event if Dave shares the staging link.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.084,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "start": 152.68,
      "end": 156.22,
      "text": " Sure. I will send the staging link to Carol this afternoon.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.084,
      "compression_ratio": 1.629
    },
    {
      "start": 157.88,
      "end": 161.44,
